 old report had 内在涨幅 +9% based on 38.80 old price. With new price 38.29 and 加权 42.3 (巴菲特), 内在涨幅 would be +10.6%.\n\nHmm, what should the Munger view's numbers be? Options:\n1. Adopt 巴菲特-style: 加权 42.3 → +10.6%, 建仓 38.5, 补仓 35.0, 🟡\n2. Keep its own slight difference with justification.\n\nThe old Munger report had: 悲观 PB 0.72 (25%) ~32.8, 中性 PB 0.93 (50%) ~42.3, 乐观 PB 1.15 (25%) ~52.3, 加权 42.4, +9% at 38.80. If we update to new price 38.29 and adjust, the 加权 42.4 → +10.7%.\n\nBut the task says: \"数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\". So I should align the numbers with the other three. The key question is which numbers to use for 建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅.\n\nGiven the three new reports differ (段永平 +14.1%/40.8, 巴菲特 +10.6%/38.5, 李录 +2.9%/37.0), the Munger perspective should pick an aligned set. The old Munger report already used 建仓 38.5 / 补仓 35.0, which matches 巴菲特's numbers. And the 加权估值 42.4 vs 巴菲特's 42.3 — nearly identical.\n\nSince 行业竞争 perspective is closest to 巴菲特's PB-ROE valuation methodology (both use PB-ROE framework), aligning with 巴菲特 makes the most sense: 内在涨幅 +10.6%, 建仓 38.5, 补仓 35.0. \n\nBut wait — the task says \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致\". Strictly, the three new reports do NOT agree among themselves (李录 37.0 vs 巴菲特 38.5 vs 段永平 40.8). Each has its own basis (李录 requires bigger discount, 段永平 uses different PB anchor 0.85x). The clause \"除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\" allows divergence with justification.\n\nSo for the Munger perspective, the most defensible alignment:\n- 内在涨幅: align with 巴菲特 +10.6% (Munger's PB-ROE weighted 42.3-42.4 vs 38.29) — since the old Munger weighted value 42.4 ≈ 巴菲特 42.3, this is consistent.\n- 建仓价: 38.5 元 (matches 巴菲特, and old Munger). \n- 补仓价: 35.0 元 (matches 巴菲特 and old Munger).\n- 击球区: 🟡附近 (consistent with 李录 and old Munger; 段永平 says 🟡偏绿, 巴菲特 says 现价已破线第一批可启动).\n\nActually, hold on. Let me reconsider. The instruction says \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\". Since the other three already differ, the Munger report should at minimum be consistent with the dominant/converged numbers. Let me think about what \"一致\" means here pragmatically: the Munger report should not be an outlier from the other three. The old report's 38.5/35.0 matches 巴菲特 exactly. The weighted value 42.4 ≈ 42.3 matches 巴菲特. So updating to new price 38.29 and aligning with 巴菲特 gives: 内在涨幅 +10.6%, 建仓 38.5, 补仓 35.0. That's the natural alignment.\n\nAlternatively, align with the consensus: the \"综合研判\" file exists (600036招商银行-综合研判-20260819.md). Let me read it — it might have the synthesized consensus numbers. That would be very useful for \"对齐\".\n\nLet me also check the dated 行业竞争 file (600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角-20260819.md) which apparently already exists — it might be a previous attempt. Wait, the task says \"读旧文件 reports/600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角.md（行业竞争 视角，内容已过时）\" and \"重写 reports/600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角.md\". The dated file 600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角-20260819.md exists... interesting. Perhaps that's from a previous run of this same task (the memory mentions \"investment-team 重复轮次工作流 — 同公司重跑时增量更新+日期后缀新文件\"). So the dated one might be the newest version. Let me read both the dated 行业竞争 file and the 综合研判 file to get the full picture.",
