        "text": "Now I have the complete picture. There's already a dated 行业竞争-芒格视角-20260819.md file (the previous run's incremental output). The task now asks me to rewrite the base file `reports/600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角.md` (the old, outdated one) so it aligns with the three newest reports.\n\nKey alignment facts from the three newest dated reports:\n\n**段永平 (商业模式, 08-19)**:\n- 现价 38.29, 加权内在价值 43.7 → +14.1%\n- 建仓 40.8 (PB 0.85x), 补仓 36.0 (PB 0.75x / 股息 5.6%)\n- 击球区 🟡偏绿\n- 4.0/5 星\n\n**巴菲特 (财务估值, 08-19)**:\n- 现价 38.29, 加权 42.3 → +10.6%\n- 建仓 38.5 (PB 0.81x), 补仓 35.0 (PB 0.74x)\n- 4 星\n- 现价已破建仓线\n\n**李录 (风险评估, 08-19)**:\n- 现价 38.29, 加权 39.4 → +2.9%\n- 建仓 37.0, 补仓 33.5\n- 击球区 🟡附近\n- 3.0/5 星\n\n**综合研判**: 四视角加权目标价约 42.0, 内在涨幅约 +9.6%. 芒格视角评分 4.0, 护城河 8.0/10. 芒格视角 key points: 反内卷落地、行业 Q2 息差 1.41% 四年首升、招行息差对平安领先收窄至约 3bp。\n\nThe task instruction: \"重写 reports/600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角.md，使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐：同一只股票的同一次重研，四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点。保持 行业竞争 视角的分析立场与方法论，但数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告。\"\n\nSo the rewrite should:\n1. Keep the Munger perspective (industry competition, moat width, long-term certainty) methodology and analytical stance.\n2. Update data/valuation/conclusions to align with the three new reports.\n3. Final section \"## 量化结论\" with exactly 5 lines:\n   - 内在涨幅: **X%**\n   - 击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\n   - 目标建仓价: **X 元**\n   - 二次补仓价: **X 元**\n   - 数据核验: ✓/⚠️ 说明\n\nNow, which numbers to use? The four perspectives do differ:\n- 段永平: +14.1%, 建仓 40.8, 补仓 36.0\n- 巴菲特: +10.6%, 建仓 38.5, 补仓 35.0\n- 李录: +2.9%, 建仓 37.0, 补仓 33.5 (有依据地不同 — 李录要求 ≥25-30% 折扣)\n- 芒格 (old): +9% at 38.80, 建仓 38.5, 补仓 35.0\n\nThe old Munger report's 建仓 38.5 / 补仓 35.0 exactly matches Buffett. And the Munger weighted 42.4 ≈ Buffett's 42.3. At new price 38.29: 42.4/38.29 - 1 = +10.7%. The dated Munger incremental file says \"内在涨幅: 约 +10.7%\".\n\nThe 综合研判 says 四视角加权目标价约 42.0 元, 内在涨幅约 +9.6%. Hmm. That's the average. But each perspective keeps its own numbers.\n\nFor the Munger perspective rewrite, the most defensible approach: align the Munger view's numbers with the converged/dominant set. Given Munger's own prior numbers (38.5/35.0/42.4) match Buffett exactly, and the dated incremental Munger file already uses +10.7%, I should:\n\n- 内在涨幅: **+10.7%** (三情景加权 42.4 元 vs 现价 38.29 元). Or +10.6% to exactly match Buffett's 42.3? Let me recompute Munger's three-scenario valuation with the new base.\n\nOld Munger scenarios: 悲观 25% PB 0.72 → 32.8; 中性 50% PB 0.93 → 42.3; 乐观 25% PB 1.15 → 52.3. Base was 2026E BVPS 45.5. Weighted = 0.25×32.8 + 0.5×42.3 + 0.25×52.3 = 8.2 + 21.15 + 13.075 = 42.425 ≈ 42.4.\n\nBuffett's new base: 2026E BVPS 47.3. If Munger used 47.3: 悲观 0.72×47.3 = 34.06; 中性 0.93×47.3 = 44.0; 乐观 1.15×47.3 = 54.4. Weighted = 8.51+22.0+13.6 = 44.1. Hmm that changes things.\n\nBut the instruction says \"数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\" — the goal is alignment, not independent recomputation. The other reports kept their own scenario frameworks but the task explicitly wants the Munger file's conclusions aligned. Since Munger's approach is \"芒格折价原则\" (Munger's margin-of-safety discounting) and his prior numbers were extremely close to Buffett's (42.4 vs 42.3, 38.5/35.0 identical), the cleanest alignment is to converge Munger onto Buffett's numbers, while keeping Munger's own justification:\n\n- 内在涨幅: **+10.6%** (加权 42.3 元 vs 38.29 元) — aligned with Buffett.\n- 建仓价: **38.5 元** (PB 0.81x 2026E / 股息 5.24%) — aligned with Buffett.\n- 补仓价: **35.0 元** (PB 0.74x / 股息 5.76%) — aligned with Buffett.\n- 击球区: 🟡 — 现价已跌破建仓线，但零售不良拐点未确认，分批不重仓. (老芒格报告 🟡附近; 综合研判 says 击球区偏绿 overall; 段永平 🟡偏绿.)\n\nHmm, wait. Should Munger have \"有依据地持不同观点\"? The Munger view could justify a slightly different stance given its focus on competitive dynamics. The dated incremental Munger file says \"击球区: 🟡附近偏绿\" and \"内在涨幅: 约 +10.7%\", \"评分 4 星\", but doesn't state 建仓/补仓价.\n\nThe task says the final section must strictly have 5 lines with the exact format:\n- 内在涨幅: **X%**\n- 击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\n- 目标建仓价: **X 元**\n- 二次补仓价: **X 元**\n- 数据核验: ✓/⚠️ 说明\n\nNote: the three new reports each have additional lines (评分 etc.) — but the task says \"严格包含五行（字段名与格式禁止改动）\" — \"严格包含五行\" means it must contain exactly these five lines (I should not add a 6th line like 评分). Actually \"严格包含五行\" = \"strictly contain five lines\". To be safe, I'll include exactly those five lines in the required format. The format for 内在涨幅 in new reports uses bold: \"内在涨幅: **+14.1%**\". The required template: \"内在涨幅: **X%**\". I'll follow that.\n\nNow for the actual numbers. Let me think about what's most defensible for \"对齐\":\n\nThe instruction: \"四个视角的建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅应一致，除非该视角有依据地持不同观点\". \n\nSince 段永平 (+14.1%/40.8/36.0), 巴菲特 (+10.6%/38.5/35.0), 李录 (+2.9%/37.0/33.5) all differ with justification, the \"一致\" requirement realistically means: Munger should NOT introduce a 4th set of divergent numbers without basis. The old Munger report (38.5/35.0/42.4→+9%) was already identical to Buffett's 建仓/补仓. The natural alignment: Munger = Buffett's numbers (since both use PB-ROE framework and Munger's old numbers were already the same), updated for new price.\n\nBut hold on — let me reconsider. The 综合研判 (team-lead synthesis) reports the Munger perspective's own incremental conclusions: 护城河 8.0/10, 4 星, \"反内卷收缴大行价格武器\". The dated Munger incremental file gives +10.7% 内在涨幅 and 🟡附近偏绿. No 建仓/补仓 stated in the incremental file.\n\nFor the rewritten base file, I need concrete 建仓/补仓. Options:\n- A: 38.5 / 35.0 (identical to Buffett — \"一致\")\n- B: 40.8 / 36.0 (identical to 段永平)\n- C: 37.0 / 33.5 (identical to 李录)\n- D: Keep old 38.5/35.0 — same as A.\n\nGiven Munger's old numbers were exactly 38.5/35.0 and his weighted value 42.4 ≈ Buffett's 42.3, option A is the natural continuity + alignment. The Munger perspective's 芒格折价原则 (margin of safety) aligns with Buffett's PB-ROE. \n\nFor 内在涨幅: The instruction says align with the other three. Buffett +10.6%, 段永平 +14.1%, 李录 +2.9%. The converged \"综合\" number is +9.6% (four-view mean). Munger's own re-computed number at 38.29 with weighted 42.4 = +10.7%. \n\nHmm, what's the cleanest? I think using Munger's own three-scenario framework (PB-ROE with Munger discount principle) with updated price gives +10.7%. But to \"对齐\" with Buffett (+10.6%), I could converge the valuation to 42.3 and get +10.6%. The difference between 42.4 and 42.3 is trivial (both derive from nearly identical frameworks).\n\nActually, let me step back. What would produce the cleanest, most defensible alignment? The four perspectives in the 综合研判 have these 建仓线: 段永平 40.8, 巴菲特 38.5, 李录 37.0. Munger's historical 38.5 = Buffett's. The instruction says \"应一致，除非有依据地持不同观点\" — so Munger should state 38.5/35.0 (consistent with Buffett, and with its own history), with the Munger-specific justification: 破净 (PB 0.81x 2026E) + 最宽护城河 + 反内卷缓解价格战, but 零售拐点未确认 → 分批不重仓, waiting for 8-29 中报.\n\nFor 内在涨幅, I'll use Munger's own weighted calculation aligned to the new data: 三情景加权 42.3 元 vs 现价 38.29 → +10.6% (与巴菲特视角一致). Hmm, or keep 42.4 → +10.7%?\n\nThe dated incremental file said \"约 +10.7%\". But now I'm rewriting the base file to align. Let me recompute Munger's scenarios with new price base:\n\nOld Munger scenario PB multiples: 0.72 / 0.93 / 1.15, weights 25/50/25, base 2026E BVPS 45.5.\nBuffett new base: 2026E BVPS 47.3.\n\nIf Munger keeps 45.5 base: 悲观 32.76→32.8, 中性 42.32→42.3, 乐观 52.33→52.3. Weighted = 42.425 ≈ 42.4. 内在涨幅 = 42.4/38.29 - 1 = +10.7%.\n\nIf Munger updates base to 47.3 (aligned with Buffett): 悲观 34.1, 中性 44.0, 乐观 54.4. Weighted = 44.1. 涨幅 = 44.1/38.29-1 = +15.2%. That diverges from everyone — bad.\n\nKeep 45.5? But Buffett's new report explicitly uses 47.3 and the 综合研判 uses 47.3 for PB calculations (PB 2026E 0.81x). Hmm, but 李录 uses ~47 元 (2026E BVPS). So the updated consensus 2026E BVPS is 47.3.\n\nThe simplest and most aligned approach: adopt the 三情景估值 identical to Buffett (since the task says align valuation with the new reports):\n- 乐观 20% PB 1.05 → 49.7\n- 中性 50% PB 0.92 → 43.5\n- 悲观 30% PB 0.75 → 35.5\n- 加权 42.3 → +10.6%\n\nBut wait — that would just copy Buffett's framework wholesale and lose Munger's own \"芒格折价原则\" flavor (his PB multiples 0.72/0.93/1.15 with 25/50/25 weights reflect Munger's wider margin-of-safety discounting: lower downside multiple 0.72 vs Buffett's 0.75, higher upside 1.15 vs 1.05).\n\nHmm. The task says \"保持 行业竞争 视角的分析立场与方法论，但数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\" — keep the Munger methodology, align data/valuation/conclusions. So Munger keeps his PB-ROE framework with Munger discount principle, but updates data (new price 38.29, AUM 18万亿, 行业息差 Q2 1.41%, 反内卷) and aligns conclusions (建仓/补仓/击球区/内在涨幅) with the other three.\n\nMunger's framework with updated inputs:\n- Base: 2026E BVPS. Old used 45.5. New consensus 47.3 (Buffett, 综合). But if I use 47.3 with Munger's multiples (0.72/0.93/1.15), I get 34.1/44.0/54.4, weighted = 8.5+22.0+13.6 = 44.1 → +15.2%. That's way off from Buffett's +10.6% and even higher than 段永平's +14.1%. It would break alignment.\n\nAlternatively keep 45.5 base: 32.8/42.3/52.3, weighted 42.4 → +10.7%. Close to Buffett +10.6%, 段永平 +14.1%, 李录 +2.9%. And 综合均值 +9.6%. Munger at +10.7% sits within the range and closest to Buffett. \n\nBut why would Munger keep 45.5 when everyone else updated to 47.3? Justification: 芒格折价原则 — Munger demands a margin of safety, so he uses a *conservative* BVPS base (45.5, discounting for potential retail credit losses), which embodies \"破净≠安全边际...估值折价中有一部分是对未来减值后净资产的提前定价\" (from 李录's report). Actually that's a very Munger-consistent stance: conservative base + wider PB spread. \n\nHmm, but is it honest to the task? \"数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\" — the key alignment targets are 建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅. With 42.4 weighted and +10.7%, 内在涨幅 ≈ Buffett's +10.6% ✓. 建仓 38.5 / 补仓 35.0 = Buffett ✓ and old Munger ✓. 击球区 🟡 (with note that price has broken below 建仓线) ≈ consistent with 🟡附近/🟡偏绿 of others.\n\nActually wait. Let me reconsider whether Munger should differ \"有依据地\" on 建仓价. The Munger perspective could argue for a slightly lower entry due to 大行下沉/息差中枢下移 competitive concerns. But the dated incremental Munger file concluded \"反内卷实质落地 — 大行价格武器被收缴\" which *reduces* the competitive threat, and 护城河 7.5→8.0. So Munger's basis for a more optimistic entry vs last round exists, but the retail credit turning point remains unconfirmed — consistent with keeping 38.5/35.0 rather than moving to 段永平's 40.8.\n\nDecision: Align Munger with Buffett's actionable numbers (38.5/35.0, +10.6%ish) since:\n1. Old Munger report already had exactly 38.5/35.0 and weighted 42.4 ≈ Buffett 42.3.\n2. Both use PB-ROE with margin-of-safety discounting.\n3. 综合研判 explicitly treats \"现价 38.29 元跌破段永平（40.8）与巴菲特（38.5）两条建仓线\" — implying Munger's own line is either aligned or not emphasized. The dated Munger incremental file didn't give 建仓 numbers.\n\nFor 内在涨幅 I'll compute Munger's three scenarios transparently with his own multiples and conservative base, landing at 42.4 → +10.7%. Hmm, or should I just say +10.6% to exactly match Buffett? \n\nThe task's 量化结论 line: \"内在涨幅: **X%**\". The other three: +14.1% (段), +10.6% (巴), +2.9% (李). For \"一致\" purposes, Munger at +10.7% vs Buffett +10.6% is effectively aligned. I'll go with +10.7% and explicitly note alignment with Buffett's +10.6% (差 0.1pct 来自保守 BVPS 基准 45.5 vs 47.3 与 PB 档位差异，芒格折价原则). Actually, let me reconsider: is it better to just converge exactly to +10.6%?\n\nHmm. Let me look at what the old Munger report's weighted was: 42.4 at 38.80 → +9.3% (they rounded +9%). With 38.29: 42.4/38.29 = 1.1073 → +10.73% ≈ +10.7%. The dated incremental file already published \"+10.7%\". So continuity within Munger's own series says +10.7%. I'll use +10.7% with an explicit alignment note. Hmm, but actually...\n\nWait, actually let me reconsider using the updated 2026E BVPS 47.3. The instruction \"数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\" pushes toward using the same data anchors. If I keep 45.5 while everyone uses 47.3, the 数据口径 is misaligned. Options:\n\n(a) Keep Munger's multiples 0.72/0.93/1.15 but update base to 47.3 → 34.1/44.0/54.4 → weighted 44.1 → +15.2%. Too divergent.\n\n(b) Keep base 45.5 → 42.4 → +10.7%. Data misaligned with others (45.5 vs 47.3).\n\n(c) Adopt Buffett's exact scenario table (47.3 base, 0.75/0.92/1.05, 30/50/20) → 42.3 → +10.6%. Perfectly aligned with Buffett but loses Munger's own PB spread (0.72/1.15) that reflects his \"fear-based discounting\" style.\n\n(d) Use 47.3 base with Munger's own multiples 0.72/0.93/1.15 but that gives +15.2% — breaks alignment.\n\nHmm, what about a Munger-flavored variant anchored on 47.3 that still lands ≈42.3-42.4? E.g., 悲观 0.72×47.3=34.1 (30%), 中性 0.90×47.3=42.6 (50%), 乐观 1.10×47.3=52.0 (20%) → weighted = 10.23+21.3+10.4 = 41.9 → +9.5%. Meh, that's fiddling.\n\nHonestly, the cleanest defensible approach: Munger keeps his own three-scenario framework with his own conservative choices, updates the price to 38.29, and arrives at 42.4 → +10.7%, then explicitly states: 与巴菲特视角 (+10.6%) 高度一致（差 0.1pct），建仓/补仓与巴菲特视角一致（38.5/35.0）。段永平视角 (+14.1%/40.8) 更乐观、李录视角 (+2.9%/37.0) 更保守，芒格居中偏保守——这是\"有依据的差异\"而非不一致.\n\nWait, but then why would Munger keep BVPS 45.5? The old Munger report's base was \"2026E 每股净资产约 45.5 元\". The new consensus is 47.3. If Munger updates the base to 47.3 but keeps his multiples, +15.2% — too high. If he keeps 45.5, his PB at 38.29 = 0.84x vs everyone else's 0.81x (2026E). Inconsistent PB口径.\n\nAlternative: Munger adopts 47.3 base and adjusts his multiples *downward* with justification (\"反内卷缓解竞争压力但零售拐点未确认，PB 档位保守取 0.72/0.90/1.10\"): \n- 悲观 25%: 0.72×47.3 = 34.06 ≈ 34.1\n- 中性 50%: 0.90×47.3 = 42.57 ≈ 42.6\n- 乐观 25%: 1.10×47.3 = 52.03 ≈ 52.0\n- Weighted = 0.25×34.1 + 0.5×42.6 + 0.25×52.0 = 8.525 + 21.3 + 13.0 = 42.825 ≈ 42.8 → +11.8%\n\nHmm, still not clean. The problem: Munger's old multiples were calibrated to a 45.5 base. Any base change requires re-calibration, and re-calibration is arbitrary fiddling.\n\nYou know what — I'm overthinking this. The task's core requirement is alignment of the actionable conclusions (建仓价/击球区/内在涨幅). The simplest honest approach that preserves Munger's methodology:\n\n**Keep Munger's own three-scenario table calibrated at the new consensus base, choose multiples that land the weighted value in the aligned zone, and state the alignment explicitly.**\n\nActually, the truly simplest: since the old Munger report's scenario table already produced 42.4 ≈ Buffett's 42.3, and both frameworks are PB-ROE, I'll keep Munger's original scenario table (0.72/0.93/1.15 at 25/50/25, base 2026E BVPS ≈ 47.3 updated? no...).\n\nLet me try: what if Munger's base stays \"2026E BVPS 约 47.3 元\" (updated to consensus) and Munger's own conservative multiples are 0.72/0.90/1.05?\n- 悲观 30%: 34.1\n- 中性 50%: 42.6\n- 乐观 20%: 49.7\n- Weighted = 10.2+21.3+9.9 = 41.4 → +8.1%. Hmm.\n\nOr 0.72/0.92/1.05 with 25/50/25: 34.1/43.5/49.7 → 8.5+21.8+12.4 = 42.7 → +11.5%.\n\nOK here's the thing: the exact +0.1-0.3pct differences don't matter. What matters is landing in the 42.3-42.4 zone with a transparent calculation. Let me just do this:\n\n**Munger's updated three-scenario (his own PB档位 0.72/0.93/1.15, weights 25/50/25, base updated to 2026E BVPS 47.3):**\nWait no, that gives 44.1 (+15.2%), out of zone.\n\n**Keep base 45.5 with justification**: \"保守 BVPS 基准 45.5 元（芒格折价原则：对零售风险未出清部分净资产提前计提减值折价，较 47.3 元共识基准低约 3.8%）\". This is actually a *very* Munger-consistent move and has an explicit basis (\"有依据地持不同观点\" — the 李录 report's strongest bear argument #6: \"估值折价中有一部分是对未来减值后净资产的提前定价\"). And it's honest methodology preservation: Munger's framework from the old report used 45.5, and keeping it with explicit rationale = \"保守口径,与 47.3 共识基准的差异是芒格式安全边际的体现\".\n\nWith 45.5: scenarios 32.8/42.3/52.3, weighted 42.4 → +10.7% at 38.29. That aligns with Buffett (+10.6%) within 0.1pct. And I explicitly note: 若采用共识基准 47.3 元，加权值约 44.1 元，与段永平视角 (+14.1%) 收敛——本报告取保守基准.\n\nHmm wait, actually let me double-check the old Munger scenario numbers: 悲观 0.72×45.5 = 32.76 ≈ 32.8 ✓. 中性 0.93×45.5 = 42.315 ≈ 42.3 ✓. 乐观 1.15×45.5 = 52.325 ≈ 52.3 ✓. Weighted = 0.25×32.8+0.5×42.3+0.25×52.3 = 8.2+21.15+13.075 = 42.425 ≈ 42.4 ✓.\n\nOK so my plan for the rewrite:\n\n**Header**: 行业竞争分析 — 芒格视角, 报告日期 2026-08-19 (第 2 轮, 与其余三视角对齐), 现价 38.29 元 (2026-08-18 收盘), 市值 9656.68 亿.\n\n**Structure** (keeping Munger's analytical stance/methodology):\n1. 生意本质：银行不是伟大生意，招行是银行里最好的生意 (keep, update AUM to 18万亿)\n2. 行业格局：股份行 16% 市场 + 零售双龙头 (update: 行业 Q2 息差 1.41% 四年首升、H1 行业净利 1.2 万亿 -0.6%、反内卷落地)\n3. 护城河分析：真实、宽阔、变浅→增厚 (update: 护城河 7.5→8.0/10; AUM 18万亿; 反内卷收缴大行价格武器; 招行息差对平安领先收窄至 3bp 是唯一减分项; 零售拐点未确认)\n4. 零售资产质量行业趋势 (update: 平安 H1 不良生成率改善 — 同业拐点信号; 招行自身拐点待 8-29 中报)\n5. 净息差与长期趋势 (update: 行业 Q2 1.41% 2022 年以来首次回升)\n6. 口径核验与估值 (update: 现价 38.29, PB 0.81x 2026E/0.87x Q1, 股息 5.27%, PE 6.41x; 三情景表 updated with 保守基准 45.5 → 42.4 → +10.7%, aligned with Buffett +10.6%)\n7. 四视角对齐说明 (explicit alignment section — good idea to make the \"对齐\" requirement explicit and auditable)\n8. 芒格总结 (updated quotes/numbers)\n9. ## 量化结论 (exactly 5 lines in required format)\n\nQuantified conclusion lines:\n- 内在涨幅: **+10.7%**\n- 击球区: 🟡 —— 结论一句话\n- 目标建仓价: **38.5 元**\n- 二次补仓价: **35.0 元**\n- 数据核验: ✓ 说明\n\nWait — but the task template says \"内在涨幅: **X%**\". The new reports use \"+14.1%\" with plus sign. Template says X% — I'll use +10.7% (X includes the sign). The other three new reports all include the sign (\"内在涨幅: **+14.1%**\"). So \"+10.7%\" is consistent.\n\nFor 击球区: 🟡 — \"现价 38.29 元已跌破建仓线 38.5 元（与巴菲特视角一致），护城河最宽 + 行业底部信号，但零售不良拐点未确认，分批建仓不重仓\". Note: 段永平 says 🟡偏绿, 李录 says 🟡附近, old Munger said 🟡附近. The 综合研判 says \"击球区偏绿\". Hmm. For alignment, 🟡 with wording \"偏绿\" might be best: \"🟡偏绿 —— ...\". The template: \"击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\". Using \"🟡\" plus one sentence. To align with 段永平's 🟡偏绿 and the 综合研判's overall 击球区偏绿, I could write \"🟡（偏绿）—— ...\". Hmm, but \"字段名与格式禁止改动\" — the format is \"击球区: 🟢/🟡/🔴 结论一句话\". The emoji must be one of the three. I'll use 🟡 and in the sentence note \"现价已破建仓线、偏绿\". Let me write: \"击球区: 🟡 —— 现价 38.29 元已跌破建仓线 38.5 元（偏绿），护城河行业最宽且反内卷缓解