42.4 vs 42.3: 42.4/38.29-1 = +10.73%; 42.3/38.29-1 = +10.47%. Both round to +10.6%? 10.47 rounds to 10.5 actually. Let me compute precisely:\n- 42.4/38.29 = 1.10734 → +10.73% ≈ +10.7%\n- 42.3/38.29 = 1.10473 → +10.47% ≈ +10.5%\n\nHmm, Buffett reported +10.6% (using 42.34 unrounded: 42.34/38.29 = 1.10577 → +10.58% ≈ +10.6%).\n\nSo Munger's 42.4 → +10.7%. If I want exact alignment with Buffett's +10.6%, I'd use 42.3 → +10.5% (which doesn't match +10.6% either unless I use 42.34).\n\nCleanest: state Munger's own weighted value 42.4 元 → 内在涨幅 +10.7%, and explicitly note \"与巴菲特视角 +10.6%（42.3 元）差 0.1pct，属同一量级收敛\". The old Munger report itself noted \"与段永平视角加权 43 元、巴菲特视角加权 42.3 元高度收敛\" — same spirit.\n\nActually — hmm, alternatively, I could just adopt Buffett's exact scenario weights to land at 42.34. But that erases Munger's own framework. No — keeping Munger's framework with explicit convergence note is better and matches how the old report handled it (\"高度收敛\").\n\nAlright. Also the dated incremental Munger file said \"约 +10.7%\" — so +10.7% is also consistent with Munger's own dated series. \n\nNow — one more question: should the rewritten base file be a full \"第 2 轮\" rewrite (replacing the old content entirely with aligned content), or should it be an incremental addendum? The task says: \"重写 reports/600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角.md，使其与其他三份最新报告的结论对齐\". The dated file 600036招商银行-行业竞争-芒格视角-20260819.md already exists as the incremental (dated) version. The base file is the \"canonical\" one to rewrite. I'll rewrite the base file as a complete standalone report (第 2 轮, 与三视角对齐版) that preserves the Munger methodology sections from the old base file but with updated data and aligned conclusions. The header can note it supersedes/aligns with the 08-19 incremental notes and the other three perspectives.\n\nHmm, wait. Actually, should I preserve the old base file's full structure (7 sections)? The task says \"保持 行业竞争 视角的分析立场与方法论，但数据、估值、结论对齐其他三份新报告\". So yes: keep the Munger analysis st