ntence.\n\nNote on 现价 38.29 vs 建仓 38.5: 现价已破线 ✓ (38.29 < 38.5).\n\nLet me double check 补仓 35.0 PB: 35.0/47.3 = 0.7400 ≈ 0.74x (2026E). 股息 = 2.016/35 = 5.76%. And 建仓 38.5: PB = 38.5/47.3 = 0.8139 ≈ 0.81x; 股息 2.016/38.5 = 5.24%. ✓ (matches Buffett's table).\n\nFor the scenario table percentages at 38.29:\n- 悲观 32.8: 32.8/38.29 - 1 = -14.3% (32.8/38.29 = 0.8566)\n- 中性 42.3: 42.3/38.29 - 1 = +10.5% (42.3/38.29 = 1.1047)\n- 乐观 52.3: 52.3/38.29 - 1 = +36.6% (52.3/38.29 = 1.3659)\n- Weighted = 42.43 → +10.8%? Let me recompute exactly:\n  0.25×32.8 = 8.2\n  0.5×42.3 = 21.15\n  0.25×52.3 = 13.075\n  Sum = 42.425\n  42.425/38.29 = 1.10799 → +10.80%\n  \n  Hmm, with rounded scenario prices, +10.8%. With unrounded (32.76/42.315/52.325): 42.42875 → 1.10809 → +10.81%. Either way ≈ +10.8%, not +10.7%!\n\n  But if I round weighted to 42.4: 42.4/38.29 = 1.10734 → +10.73% ≈ +10.7%. \n\n  The old report did: \"三情景加权：约 42.4 元 → 内在涨幅 +9%\" — with 38.80: 42.4/38.80 = 1.09278 → +9.28% ≈ +9% ✓ (they used rounded 42.4). So consistency: use 42.4 → 42.4/38.29 = 1.10734 → +10.73% ≈ +10.7%. Good — consistent methodology with the old report (round weighted to 42.4 first, then compute).\n\nSo: 三情景加权 = 42.425 ≈ 42.4 元 → 内在涨幅 = 42.4 ÷ 38.29 − 1 = +10.73% ≈ +10.7%. ✓\n\nThat lands at +10.7% matching the dated incremental file. \n\nNow let me write the final file. I need to preserve Munger's analytical voice (行业竞争/护城河/长期确定性), keep the old file's overall section structure (which is the \"方法论\"), update all data, and align conclusions. The file must end with \"## 量化结论\" with exactly 5 lines.\n\nLet me now also double-check a few data points I'm citing:\n- AUM 18 万亿 ✓ (三源一致 per 李录 report)\n- 行业 Q2 息差 1.41% 四年首升 ✓\n- 行业 H1 净利 1.2 万亿, -0.6% ✓ (李录: \"上半年行业净利润 1.2 万亿、-0.6%，降幅显著收窄\"; 巴菲特: \"行业（金监总局 08-14）2026H1 合计 1.2 万亿\")\n- 行业平均 ROE 7.72% (金监总局 08-14, per 巴菲特) ✓\n- 行业 Q2 不良 1.52% +1bp ✓\n- 反内卷: <3% 消费贷绝迹、自律公约扩围 ✓ (dated Munger incremental)\n- 平安 H1: 息差 1.80% 同比持平、Q2 环比 +2bp 至 1.81%, 净利 +3.3%, 不良 1.05%, 不良